   00142| // R499-6: the *same* teaching directive that the chat handler recognizes also
   00143| // drives the Agent CLI learning recipe — one seed-declared source, two entry
   00144| // points. The directive routes into the same `write_file -> run_command -> final`
   00145| // loop the operator-worded task uses and writes the committed learning artifact.
   00146| #[test]
   00147| fn the_reported_directive_drives_the_learning_recipe_via_agent_cli() {
   00148|     // The literal user directive is enough to select the learning recipe; no
   00149|     // English operator framing ("learning frontier" / "self-improvement loop") is
